digraph account_payable_process_61 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the receiving department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the receiving department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"double check a three-way match" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" -> "double check a three-way match"
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_JIKJ" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"double check a three-way match" -> "AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_JIKJ"
		"schedule the payment" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_JIKJ" -> "schedule the payment"
		"create voucher for the documents" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_JIKJ" -> "create voucher for the documents"
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_C5TT" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"schedule the payment" -> "OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_C5TT"
		"stamp all documents" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_C5TT" -> "stamp all documents"
		"store in paid invoice file" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--4. Payment_C5TT" -> "store in paid invoice file"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" [shape=box]
		"stamp all documents" -> "enter the invoice into the accounts payable account"
		"check dates to avoid penalty charges" [shape=box]
		"store in paid invoice file" -> "check dates to avoid penalty charges"
		"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_C5TT" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_C5TT"
		"check dates to avoid penalty charges" -> "OR_JOIN--4. Payment_C5TT"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_JIKJ" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"OR_JOIN--4. Payment_C5TT" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_JIKJ"
		"create voucher for the documents" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_JIKJ"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the receiving department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_JIKJ" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the receiving department. 
After sending to the receiving department, you need to create a receiving report.
After creating a receiving report, you need to double check a three-way match.
After doubling check a three-way match, the process is split into 2 parallel branches: scheduling the payment and creating voucher for the documents. 
When scheduling the payment is completed, one or more of the following paths should be executed: stamping all documents, storing in paid invoice file. 
Once stamping all documents occurs, you need to enter the invoice into the accounts payable account.
After storing in paid invoice file, checking dates to avoid penalty charges needs to be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
}
